<title>CANADA: EnerMark revises FY 1996 earnings forecast up.</title>
<headline>EnerMark revises FY 1996 earnings forecast up.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>EnerMark Income Fund on Tuesday revised its fiscal 1996 (Jan/Dec) earnings forecast up to C$1.03 a unit from C$0.90, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The revised earnings forecast was based on the recent acquisition of the Giltedge area and strength in WTI crude oil prices, it said.</p>
<p>Funds available for distribution for the period between April 3, 1996, to December 31, 1996, were revised up 17 percent to C$0.77 from C$0.66 a unit, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras (204) 947 3548</p>
